# SIDE JOB - PIT LADDER (repeatable underground fights)
mission 20
key s20
title "Pit Ladder"
desc "Sal always has another fighter who thinks he can take you. Two rounds, winner takes the purse."
start fight_pit 5 0
requires 3
reward 300
side
repeatable

group crowd civilian - 10 @fight_pit 0 31 7 civilian fists spectate
goto @fight_pit 0 20.5 1.8 "Step into the ring"
spawn p1 fighter fighter @fight_pit 0 26 180 fighter fists hold
name p1 "Challenger"
nonlethal p1
hostile p1
sound cheer
defeat p1 "Round 1: Win the fight"
pit_win
heal
spawn p2 fighter fighter @fight_pit -2 26 180 fighter fists hold
spawn p2 fighter fighter @fight_pit 2 26 180 fighter fists hold
name p2 "Challenger"
nonlethal p2
hostile p2
sound cheer
defeat p2 "Round 2: Two challengers"
pit_win
sound cheer
end
